 "wishes": [
  "a flared cross whose top arm is the entering stem and whose foot is a bell; rendered as cross plus tri",
  "a barbed arrowhead (triangle with a notched base)"
 ],
 "notes": "A long diagonal from a ring at the top-left down to a B-shaped letter at the right; two more rings on stems meet the diagonal in a V and a stem drops from there to a bar between two rings, then a hook curls under to an arrowhead pointing left, with a ring in its crook. A spear stands in the middle: outlined triangle head, stem down to a flared cross on a bell foot. The B has three ring bowls, a ring on a bar at its waist, and at each end of its spine a ring and a curl; the curls have the same handedness, so only the rings and bowls are mirrored."
